<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48022" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θει-άζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῖος</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be
				inspired, frenzied</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπόσοι αὐτοὺς
				θειάσαντες ἐπήλπισαν</span> as many as made them hope
				<i>by divinations</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. καὶ θεοφορεῖται</span>
			<i>is divinely inspired</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.479
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπόσοι τελεταῖς ἐθείαζον</span>
			<i>obtained inspiration</i> through ritual, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Her.</u>
				5.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>prophesy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτι στρατοπεδεύσοιτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					57.48
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος] ἐπὶ τῇ τελευτῇ τοῦ
					Ἀλεξάνδρου ἐθειάσθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					7.18.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγιον ὑπὸ τοῦ ὁμίλου θειασθέν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					62.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>worship as divine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				59.27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πυθαγόραν καὶ Πλάτωνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Isid.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				8.9
			</span></i>.</div>
